{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And they encamped by the Sea of Reeds.</b> Between Elim and the wilderness of Sin, the Sea of Reeds extended toward the wilderness in the direction they turned." "<b>And they encamped by the Sea of Reeds, and they encamped in Dophkah, and they encamped in Alush.</b> These three encampments were not written in the perashah of Beshalaḥ, for there it writes: ״ויסעו מאלים ויבאו אל מדבר סין ויחנו ברפידים.״ Rather, the verse included them there when it wrote: ״ויבאו כל עדת בני ישראל מדבר סין ויחנו ברפידים״ — in the perashah of Beshalaḥ."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:35.149659387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}